      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would get annoying if it set your old calibration from a day or so ago, and using how long ago the calibration was may not work. \nYou could have calibrated an hour before a crash, but you could also take a break for an hour and come back with new tracker placements.\nSomething reasonable like within 5 minutes since a crash or reboot would be lovely. Saving the calibration data to cache and using the previous log file timestamp as an indicator for when the client last ran would probably work.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
